Moon rises and serves Hanumān with cool rays --- Hanumān sees moon-faced Sītā sunk under grief near Rākṣasīs --- Beast-faced Rākṣasīs drink wine and eat meat around tree --- Hanumān notes soiled unadorned Sītā dim like muddied lotus and veiled moon --- Hanumān rejoices sheds tears bows to Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa staying hidden
